  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p id=\"isPasted\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Brand Introduction:</span>&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"http://wearcuft.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CUFT</a> is a non-toxic, sustainable underwear brand on a mission to provide women with <em data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"236\" data-is-only-node=\"\" id=\"isPasted\">Better for You Underwear™</em>. Designed with health, comfort, and the planet in mind, CUFT offers an everyday essential, made from clean, compostable materials.</p><p style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;  widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;  text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;word-spacing:  0px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Product Description:&nbsp;</span></strong>CUFT underwear is made with 100% TENCEL™—a breathable, hypoallergenic, and compostable fabric that's free from toxins, microplastics, and harmful chemicals. It comes in two styles, thong and bikini, and three colors: blush, caramel, and charcoal.</p><p style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;  widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;  text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;word-spacing:  0px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">The Perks: </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complimentary samples of CUFT products. Collab opportunities on social media. A library of brand assets &amp; post inspiration. First access to product launches &amp; events!</span></p><p style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;  widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;  text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;word-spacing:  0px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Nontoxic, free of harmful chemicals, no harsh dyes, no microplastics.</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\" role=\"presentation\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Naturally prevents infections.</span></strong> TENCEL helps to prevent bacterial growth, potentially reducing the risk of infections.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\" role=\"presentation\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Naturally antibacterial.</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">&nbsp;</span>TENCEL naturally helps stop bacteria from growing by pulling moisture away, making it harder for bacteria to build up.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\" role=\"presentation\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Quick drying.</span></strong> TENCEL pulls moisture away from your skin and dries fast, so your underwear never feels damp or soggy.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\" role=\"presentation\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Naturally odor repellent.</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">&nbsp;</span>TENCEL naturally fights odors by pushing moisture away from your skin, keeping you dry and making it harder for odor causing bacteria to grow.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\" role=\"presentation\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Breathable.</span></strong> TENCEL is super breathable. It keeps sweat off your skin and lets air flow through, so you stay cool and comfortable, which is great for hot days.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\" role=\"presentation\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Gynecologist approved.</span></strong> TENCEL is often gynecologist-recommended because it’s breathable, hypoallergenic, and helps keep you dry, reducing the risk of irritation or infection.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">No visible panty lines or wedgies.</span>&nbsp;</strong>CUFT fits perfectly underneath my workout leggings and actually stays put so I'm not digging around fixing my wedgie!</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Great for working out.</span></strong> CUFT undies are perfect for working out because they’re breathable, moisture-wicking, and naturally odor-resistant - keeping you dry, fresh, and comfortable through every sweat.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;  text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:  baseline;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 28px; text-indent: -0.25in; vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Payment Terms:</span></strong> 30 days</p></div></div>",
